Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:55.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《魔鬼之足》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.13,0:02:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个在哈利街的医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does a Harley Street specialist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.02,0:02:29.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凭什么知道我的健康状况呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}know about my health?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.64,0:02:30.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:33.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}穆尔·阿加医生坚持要你彻底休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Moor Agar insists you have a complete rests{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:36.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则你的身体就要完全垮掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you wish to avoid an absolute breakdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海边的空气对你的健康有利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sea air will do you the world of good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.55,0:02:45.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你该独自旅行的 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have traveled alone, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.15,0:02:46.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nonsense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:48.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在休假中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're on holiday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.61,0:03:19.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太美妙了 福尔摩斯 简直太美妙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why it's wonderful, Holmes, wonderful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:21.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里的景色真是壮观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The views are spectacular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.65,0:03:23.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们正处在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well we're looking at the most dangerous piece{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:25.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我国最险峻的一处海岸线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of coastline in the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.05,0:03:28.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的朋友是位自然历史学家？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend is a natural historian I presume?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.89,0:03:31.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大学时代的老相识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An old acquaintance from my college days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.27,0:03:44.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我去看下行李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see to the luggage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.17,0:03:45.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.11,0:03:52.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day to you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.91,0:03:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想之后几周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought as we were going to be neighbors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.88,0:03:58.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们会成为邻居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the next few weeks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:00.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我应当来欢迎一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ought to say a few words of welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.15,0:04:01.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How very kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:03.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且我当然渴望见到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And of course I've long wanted to meet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:05.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生 我真的很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is indeed a pleasure, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 但我是约翰·华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you but I'm Doctor John Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:11.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.34,0:04:16.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.87,0:04:21.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的好朋友 夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my good friend Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.47,0:04:23.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常抱歉我本该意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thousand apologies, I should have realized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.67,0:04:25.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请进吧 朗德海先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do come in Mr. Roundhay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:28.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真是太蠢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very stupid of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:30.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您怎么知道我的名字的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know my name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:33.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对考古很感兴趣是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have an interest in archeology do you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:34.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么知道的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:37.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你来继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deduce, Watson, go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:39.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}推理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deduce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:41.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你鞋尖上 膝盖下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got mud on the points of your shoes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:44.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和右手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and beneath your knees{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:46.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都沾有泥土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and on the fingers of your right hand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.03,0:04:48.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太精彩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splendid, splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.47,0:04:50.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这说明你之前跪了一段时间在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which indicates that you've knelt on the ground for a length of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:52.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你越来越不可思议了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Watson, you're coming along marvelously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:53.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是个左撇子园丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a left-handed gardener.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:55.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是考古专业的学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a student of archeology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:04:57.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你发表了一篇关于新石器时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've published a paper over theories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:04:59.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}埋葬风俗的文章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}surrounding the neolithic burial rites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:01.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您 尊敬的弗朗西斯·朗德海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the Reverend Francis Roundhay, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:03.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是当地教区的牧师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}vicar of the parish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:08.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太惊人了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Astonishing, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:10.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 请坐 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please sit down. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.97,0:05:14.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但左撇子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But left-handed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:18.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你拿钓绳的那只手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hand with which you hold the troll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.73,0:05:20.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完全正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.26,0:05:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每个细节都准确无误 但是你是怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precise in every detail but how sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:23.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:25.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教区牧师…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vicar, vicar vic...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:26.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这本教区的杂志…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the parish magazine has...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:37.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}村子就在这附近吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The village is nearby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:40.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 沿着滨海小道就能走到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes just along the coastal path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:42.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}村子很偏僻 但能满足我们全部所需\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's secluded but it caters for all our needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:44.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是最近的居所吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose is that the nearest habitation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:46.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 还有特雷根尼斯家的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, the Tregennis Estate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.99,0:05:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在内陆一英里处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is about a mile inland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:49.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常和善的一家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信他们会向你展示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm sure they'll extend to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:55.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}康沃尔人的热情好客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some fine Cornish hospitality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:55.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:59.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经打扰你们太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've imposed enough upon you for one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:00.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许你们愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you'd care to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.53,0:06:01.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来我的住处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come and have dinner with me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.87,0:06:03.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}共进晚餐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one evening at the vicarage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.23,0:06:05.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们就要打扰到你和你的家人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh then we should impose upon you and your family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.70,0:06:07.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦不会的 我是单身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no alas, I have no family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:09.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和特雷根尼斯先生住在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I live alone except for Mr. Tregennis, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.37,0:06:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他住其中的一间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has a suite of rooms in the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:13.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他为什么不住在自家房子里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But does he not live on the estate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:15.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}家庭不合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A family dispute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.41,0:06:17.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的妹妹和两个兄弟住在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His sister and two brothers live there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:19.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他选择搬出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he chooses to live apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:25.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去牧师家里共进晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know dinner at the vicarage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:28.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是个很好的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a splendid idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:30.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得安排一下时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must arrange a date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:37.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是当然的 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, well of course gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:39.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你们过得愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}good day to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:07.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:16.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}康沃尔人的热情好客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cornish hospitality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:20.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}风化后凹凸不平的花岗岩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weathered pitted slabs of granite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:23.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}古时的坟墓散布在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ancient tombs scattered throughout{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.51,0:07:26.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个半岛冗长的岁月里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the lengthened breath of this peninsula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.14,0:07:28.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像大海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.91,0:07:32.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想死亡始终如影随形吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose death is always with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.19,0:07:40.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:07:59.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在康沃尔的这些日子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite often during those days in Cornwall, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:02.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯常常独自出行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes would stride out alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:05.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此地的神秘与魅力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mystery and glamour of the place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:08.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及被遗忘的民族留下的不祥之气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with its sinister atmosphere of forgotten nations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吸引着我这位朋友的想象力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}appeal to the imagination of my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他花很长时间漫步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He spent much of his time in long walks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:17.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}独自冥想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and solitary meditation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:03.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而在一个早晨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One morning however, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我朋友的恢复疗养\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my friend's convalescence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:07.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被粗暴地打断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was violently interrupted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们 我强烈建议你们求助于警方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen I urge you to consult the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.27,0:09:13.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯是位病人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes is a sick man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.31,0:09:18.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但在渐渐康复中 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes but getting better all the time, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:24.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是有紧急事件发生吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a matter of some emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.89,0:09:26.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.49,0:09:28.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们只能将您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can only regard it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.82,0:09:30.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恰巧出现在此时此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as a special Providence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看做是上天的特别眷顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you should chance to be here at this time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.33,0:09:34.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为在整个英格兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for in all England{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:35.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是我们唯一真正需要的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are the one man we truly need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:37.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我试图跟特雷根尼斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to explain to Mr. Tregennis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.27,0:09:38.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和朗德海先生解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Mr. Roundhay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.53,0:09:40.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说你在疗养\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you're in convalescence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:42.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信他们一定赞成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes I'm sure they'll be very sympathetic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:43.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}please sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:46.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.81,0:09:48.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如我向华生医生所解释的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as I've explained to Doctor Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.84,0:09:51.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一件异常骇人的悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the most extraordinary and tragic affair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.91,0:09:53.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨晚发生在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has occurred here during the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:56.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洗耳恭听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have my full attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:59.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我应该先介绍一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps I had better say a few words first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是我曾提到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Mr. Tregennis, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:03.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of whom I spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:06.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯先生昨晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Mr. Tregennis spent last night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.89,0:10:08.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与他的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the company of his brother, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:09.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乔治和欧文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}George and Owen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.93,0:10:11.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及妹妹布兰达一同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his sister Brenda, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:13.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在特里丹尼克·沃拉斯的房子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at their house of Tredannick Wartha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.77,0:10:15.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他走的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:16.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们围坐在餐桌前玩牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}playing cards around the dining table{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}身体和精神状态都很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in excellent health and spirits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.31,0:10:22.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他今天早上回去的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But on his return this morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.57,0:10:26.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发现情形极其诡异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he discovered a truly bizarre state of affairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.81,0:10:29.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}三个人 不论生者还是死者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All three both alive and dead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.21,0:10:31.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脸上都保留着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}retained upon their faces{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:34.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}极度恐惧的表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an expression of the utmost horror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.05,0:10:37.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死者呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.09,0:10:38.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死于惊恐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A convulsion of terror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:46.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}惨不忍睹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was dreadful to look upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.23,0:10:48.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}房里还有其它人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there any sign of anyone else in the house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:50.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有波特女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only Mrs. Porter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:52.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是厨师兼管家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cook and housekeeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:53.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她昨晚睡得很沉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had slept deeply{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:56.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没听见任何声响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and heard no sound in the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:11:00.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么异常被遗漏了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is anything missing, disarranged?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:02.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:03.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是怎样的恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What could possibly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能够让一位青年女子死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}frighten a young woman to death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.11,0:11:06.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让两位壮汉疯掉呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and two strong men out of their senses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:07.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 会是什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes what indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.75,0:11:10.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我相信本地警方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I'm sure, Holmes, that the local police{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将会得出结论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would have reached some conclusions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:14.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但很可能是不正确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, erroneous they may be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:16.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:17.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想一想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:21.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我昨晚的情况 特雷根尼斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about last night, Mr. Tregennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:23.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:28.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在那里吃过晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I supped there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:31.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如牧师所说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the vicar has said, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.37,0:11:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后我的哥哥乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my elder brother George{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:38.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}提议玩一会儿扑克牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}proposed a game of whist afterwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:40.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我走的时候是十点一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a quarter-past ten when I moved to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.65,0:11:42.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁送你出门？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who let you out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:44.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}波特夫人已经睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Potter had gone to bed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.28,0:11:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我自己出了门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I let myself out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.92,0:11:49.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们所处房间的窗户都关着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The window of the room in which they sat was closed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.22,0:11:52.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但窗帘并没有拉上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the blind was not drawn down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:53.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was no change{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.89,0:11:55.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}门和窗子都和昨晚一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in door or window this morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:57.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也没有理由怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nor any reason to think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.43,0:12:01.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有陌生人进入过房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that any stranger had been to the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:04.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们就坐在原地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet there they sat, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.04,0:12:08.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完全被吓疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}driven clean mad with terror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:10.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我有生之年我都无法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never get the sight of that room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:14.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把那个房间的景象从我脑海中磨灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out of my mind so long as I live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:19.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊 事实总是最深刻的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the facts are most remarkable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:22.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯先生你个人认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Tregennis do you have any theory of your own{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:24.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们为何会遭此不幸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which might account for them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.45,0:12:26.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is devilish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.49,0:12:29.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}魔鬼 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Devilish, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.69,0:12:33.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那力量不属于这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not of this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.10,0:12:34.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果这个事件已超出人类范畴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well the matter is beyond humanity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:36.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那它自然也超出我的能力范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is certainly beyond me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:41.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确如此 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust so, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.44,0:12:49.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仔细想一想 特雷根尼斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think very carefully, Mr. Tregennis, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨晚你们在一起的时间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about the evening that you spent together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:55.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你记忆里有没有什么特别的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does anything stand out in your memory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:59.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能为这场惨剧提供一点线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which might throw some light upon this tragedy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:02.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:04.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是容易不安的人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were they nervous people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们曾表现出任何恐惧的预兆吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did they ever show any sign of apprehension?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.26,0:13:09.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为没有 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to my knowledge, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:13.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你就对我的探案没什么帮助了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then there's nothing in which you can assist me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:21.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我突然想起一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is one thing occurs to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.51,0:13:24.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我坐在桌边的时候背对着窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I sat at the table my back was to the window, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:26.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的哥哥乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my brother George, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:28.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玩牌的时候和我一伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he being my partner at cards, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.61,0:13:30.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}面朝窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was facing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.45,0:13:33.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我见他有一次从我肩上看过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw him once look hard over my shoulder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.69,0:13:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我也回头看了看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I turned round and looked also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.95,0:13:40.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窗帘没拉 窗户关着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blind was up and the window shut, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只能看到庭院里的矮树丛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I could just make out the bushes on the lawn, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.53,0:13:45.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但有一个瞬间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it seemed to me for a moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:50.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我好像看到有什么东西在移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I saw something moving among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.13,0:13:53.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说不清那是人或动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't even say if it was man or animal, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:57.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是觉得有东西在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I just thought I saw something there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.41,0:14:00.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没想要弄清楚吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you not investigate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:02.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时认为没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well the matter passed as unimportant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:05.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看到任何恶魔的迹象吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have any premonition of evil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None that I was aware of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.11,0:14:08.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么会这么早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you hear the terrible news{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:10.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就得知噩耗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so early this morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.15,0:14:11.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我习惯早起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am an early riser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:14.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一般在早餐前散步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Generally take a walk before breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.19,0:14:15.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今早我刚刚出门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This morning I had hardly started{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:16.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}理查德医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when Doctor Richard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.55,0:14:19.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}驾着马车找到了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}overtook me in his carriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.13,0:14:21.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Tregennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:25.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我刚从你妹妹家得知了一条紧急消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've just heard an urgent message from your sister's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:26.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.23,0:14:27.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是很确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not quite sure, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.73,0:14:30.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你最好还是跟我去一趟吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you'd better come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.74,0:14:40.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她死了至少六个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's been dead at least six hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.01,0:14:45.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有施暴的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No signs of violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.08,0:14:48.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:52.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯先生 我从未见过这种情形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen the like, Mr. Tregennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:58.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么多年来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not in all my years has a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.83,0:15:00.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来扶着你 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got you. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:04.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:06.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:10.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他差点也在我们面前出事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We nearly got him on our hands as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:16.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要去哪儿 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去特里丹尼克·沃拉斯 不能耽搁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tredannick Wartha without delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:19.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With your permission Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:19.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请您允许我先走一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go on ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:20.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 牧师 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you vicar, quickly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.84,0:15:22.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则我们就要比你先到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}otherwise we'll be there before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.19,0:15:23.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我必须劝阻你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, I must protest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:25.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把你的劝阻留着吧 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save your protestations for later, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.55,0:15:26.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多留一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}much later!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:29.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你因为某些原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gather you were divided{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.46,0:15:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和你的家庭分开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in some way from your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.99,0:15:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes sir, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:35.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那已经是过去的事情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well the matter is past and done with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:36.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都已经被原谅和遗忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All was forgiven and forgotten{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们曾是最亲密的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we were the best of friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:41.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们家曾在雷德鲁斯作锡矿工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were a family of tin-miners at Redruth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.74,0:15:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们把家族企业卖给了一家公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we sold out our venture to a company, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.27,0:15:47.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就此退休并有了足够的钱维持生计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and so retired with enough to keep us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.57,0:15:49.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不否认分家产的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't deny there was some bad feeling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.38,0:15:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一些不愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over the division of the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:53.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}彼此间的不睦有很多年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It stood between us for a number of years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.51,0:15:55.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nevertheless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:01.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你决定不离开康沃尔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You decided not to leave Cornwall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.95,0:16:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我还怀着某天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I supposed I entertained{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.82,0:16:07.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欣喜的回到家人身边的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some hopes of returning home one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:08.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}' Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.37,0:16:15.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 快靠边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, stand back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.40,0:16:25.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:27.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们要被送去赫尔斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're taking them to Helston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.39,0:16:52.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这房子真不错 特雷根尼斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a lovely house, Mr. Tregennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.90,0:16:54.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是很悲伤的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a very sad house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.07,0:16:56.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是你看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:16:58.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}影子的那扇窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through which you saw the shadow form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.37,0:17:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它距离窗户大概有多远？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approximately what distance was it from the glass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:07.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想不少于10英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say not less than ten feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:10.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a guess, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大概这么远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.69,0:17:14.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有强迫闯入的迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no sign of a forced entry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:15.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窗户当然是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the window, of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:16.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一直锁着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would have remained locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:18.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我妹妹查看它是否锁着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sister made sure of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.49,0:17:20.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即便在康沃尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even in Cornwall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.26,0:17:22.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太抱歉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So dreadfully sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:24.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没关系 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's quite all right, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:27.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.21,0:17:37.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:41.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能告诉波特夫人我回来了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you let Mrs. Porter know I'm back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:11.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想见见管家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should like to meet the housekeeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:12.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.01,0:18:14.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但请尽量避免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh but please try to avoid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:16.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再让她过于悲痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}causing further distress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死亡总是悲痛的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death is always distressing, Mr.Tregennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:24.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 椅子呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe, the chairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.56,0:18:25.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在警察离开这里后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well they must have been moved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.02,0:18:28.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它们一定被移动过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after the police left the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:31.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那把是在这儿 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one here, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:32.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这把在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:34.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:38.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这把在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:41.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有什么其他东西被移动过吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has anything else been moved?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:44.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有都跟我记忆中一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All is as I remember it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.37,0:18:45.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一定了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.21,0:18:47.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今早我来这儿的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was a great deal of fuss and confusion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:49.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是多么的忙乱和困惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I arrived this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:50.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能有东西被移动过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things may have been moved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.01,0:18:52.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有想到它们在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without thought given to their significance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:53.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}犯罪调查中的重要性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a criminal investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.43,0:18:54.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}犯罪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Criminal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.42,0:18:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个词很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a very interesting word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.05,0:18:59.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说你又不赞成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you no longer subscribe to the theory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.69,0:19:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所谓超自然的解释了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a supernatural explanation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.96,0:19:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:09.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大家是怎么坐的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where were people sitting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.03,0:19:12.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我坐在这儿 面对着乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sat here facing Georgie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.66,0:19:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my brother George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.10,0:19:17.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰达挨着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brenda sat next to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:18.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欧文对着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Owen across from her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:19.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 这很古怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh that's curious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.53,0:19:20.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是说从这个位置看出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean from this position{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:25.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窗外的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the figure outside of the window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:27.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想必要超过6英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must have been well over six feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.28,0:19:32.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我只能如实告诉你我所见到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only tell you what I saw Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.85,0:19:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 这是我们的管家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe, this is my housekeeper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:38.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}波特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Porter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:43.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的 我想让你见一下这些先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like you to meet these gentlemen, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是那么美丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was so beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:54.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么… 美… 丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.84,0:19:57.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她还是很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is still very upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.27,0:20:00.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都很难过 朗德海先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all very upset Mr. Roundhay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.71,0:20:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:04.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会再留在这个房子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not stay in this house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.48,0:20:06.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多一秒钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one moment longer than I have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要回到自己家去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I shall rejoin my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:14.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你也是我们家的一份子啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're part of our family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:17.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯一家已经不在了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The family Tregennis is dead, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.99,0:20:20.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少是如死了一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead or as good as.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.73,0:20:24.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还活着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.53,0:20:26.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}波特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Porter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:32.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}excuse me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.97,0:20:34.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}波特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Porter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:45.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我叫夏洛克 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.29,0:20:49.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你能告诉我所有你知道的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'd like you to tell me all that you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.09,0:20:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生是位侦探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes is a detective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:52.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是来想要找出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to try and find out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:55.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰达发生了什么 别紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what happened to Brenda. Don't you worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.46,0:21:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请不要有所保留\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, leave nothing out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.67,0:21:04.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只知道很少 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can tell you very little, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:13.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你出老千\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe, you've been cheating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:14.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not cheating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.91,0:21:17.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欧文 告诉你亲爱的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Owen will you tell your dearest sister{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:19.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}按规则玩牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to play by the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.88,0:21:21.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她也是你妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well she's your sister too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你跟她说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.69,0:21:24.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但她是跟你一伙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she's on your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:25.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时候不早了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's rather late{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:28.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得回牧师家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I do have to get back to the vicarage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.33,0:21:36.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫提默 你晚上还是留宿在这里吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mortimer you must stay here for the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:39.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}答应了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh please say you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.37,0:21:40.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:43.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他不愿意就不要强迫他 布兰达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't force him to stay if he doesn't want to, Brenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.47,0:21:45.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh really, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:48.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以为我们的争执已经结束了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we'd put an end to our squabbling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:49.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫提默对我来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mortimer is just as much my brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:52.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟你和乔治一样亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you and Georgie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.95,0:21:54.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不用担心 兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, dear brother, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.05,0:21:56.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道我不受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know where I'm not welcome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.17,0:21:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那干嘛还来拜访我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why visit us at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:21:59.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你离开了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You disowned us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.62,0:22:01.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是你已经忘了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or have you have forgotten?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.29,0:22:02.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贝丝 这样就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be all right now, Beth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.69,0:22:04.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以去就寝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you wish to retire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.29,0:22:06.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯先生今晚会住在这里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Mr. Tregennis staying with us tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.73,0:22:07.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.96,0:22:10.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}波特夫人 你也不愿意我在这里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you also object to my presence, Mrs. Porter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:11.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫提默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mortimer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:16.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想知道我用不用给你的房间通风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know should I air your room, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.37,0:22:21.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.58,0:22:25.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Beth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:27.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样就可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll be quite all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.45,0:22:30.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯不会留宿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Tregennis will not be staying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.41,0:22:32.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 布兰达小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, Miss Brenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.95,0:22:34.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们习惯于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it customary to have a fire in the room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.69,0:22:36.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个时节在屋里点火吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at this time of year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:38.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}外面又湿又冷 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a cold and damp night, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.56,0:22:39.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我倒是觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I must say I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.99,0:22:41.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里是湿热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was rather humid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.03,0:22:43.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有轻微的血症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I suffer with a mild blood disorder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.93,0:22:45.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在温暖的夜晚也会觉得寒冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}feel the cold on even warm nights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.03,0:22:47.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how you feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:49.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}波特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe, Mrs. Porter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你今早来的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was the door to this room closed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.70,0:22:53.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}门是锁着的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you left this morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.24,0:22:55.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh certainly, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.77,0:23:06.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夜莺在山谷下歌唱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nightingale as they sing in the valley below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.05,0:23:08.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}歌唱…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As they sing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.92,0:23:26.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安置好他们后 我把窗户大开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they were covered I threw wide the window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.43,0:23:30.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让早晨的空气透进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to let in the morning air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.31,0:23:33.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后我跑到小路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I run down to the lane{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.14,0:23:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫了个农夫去找大夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sent a farm lad for the doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.95,0:23:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接下来的我想你已经知道了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the rest I think you know, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.45,0:23:48.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}波特夫人说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Porter's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.86,0:23:50.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的确很美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's very beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.06,0:23:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊 但有什么被遗漏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes but something's missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.66,0:23:55.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯绝对没有轻微的血症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tregennis is lying about a mild blood disorder;{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.13,0:23:56.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以我的名誉担保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll state my reputation on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.49,0:23:58.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.35,0:24:24.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.09,0:24:25.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.23,0:24:32.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.66,0:24:35.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这很罕见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.30,0:24:42.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.34,0:24:43.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.64,0:24:45.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}三个人因为某种有意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three people grievously stricken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.28,0:24:49.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或无意的人类行动 而受到极度惊吓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by some conscious or unconscious human agency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.68,0:24:52.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.68,0:24:55.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事件确切发生在什么时候呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when exactly did this event occur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.75,0:24:59.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们打完牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're finished playing cards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.12,0:25:01.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经过了他们通常就寝的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was past their usual hour for bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.22,0:25:02.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}椅子并没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The panel of the chairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.79,0:25:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被推到桌子下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had not been pulled back from the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.85,0:25:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么应该就在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it must have been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.96,0:25:07.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯离开之后不久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only moments after Tregennis left the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.93,0:25:09.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.53,0:25:13.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 你一定注意到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your conscious, of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.83,0:25:15.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我设法得到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've managed to obtain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.17,0:25:16.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的清晰脚印\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a clear imprint of his foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.75,0:25:18.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 看见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes I saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.51,0:25:26.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得到了他的脚印\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven got a sample print{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.07,0:25:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就能从其他脚印中鉴别出他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could pick out his tracks among the others{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.95,0:25:31.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从而判断他的行踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and follow his boots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.62,0:25:34.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}根据他的步幅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the length of his stride{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.25,0:25:38.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他很快就回到了牧师家中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he returns swiftly to the vicarage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.89,0:25:40.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯离开后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tregennis disappeared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.66,0:25:42.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几乎立刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then almost instantly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.21,0:25:45.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某人就让兄妹三人受了惊吓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some other person affected the card players.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.00,0:25:48.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们该如何推测这个人是谁呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can we reconstruct that person?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.33,0:25:51.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 有什么确凿证据证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But is there any evidence really, Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.97,0:25:55.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确有人爬上了窗户吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that anyone did creep up to that window?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.14,0:25:57.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唯一的暗示来自于特雷根尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only suggestion comes from Tregennis, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.94,0:26:00.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说他哥哥感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who says that his brother reacted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.09,0:26:02.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}花园里有动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to some movement in the garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.88,0:26:04.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那这种恐怖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then how was this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.45,0:26:07.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是如何散布的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}impression of horror conveyed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.12,0:26:17.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就是那个侦探 夏洛克 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Mr. Sherlock Holmes the detective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.59,0:26:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就是 利昂 斯滕代尔医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are Doctor Leon Sterndale, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.73,0:26:21.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伟大的猎狮者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the great lion-hunter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.36,0:26:23.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及著名的非洲探险家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and famous African explorer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.16,0:26:25.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么进展吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you made any progress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.20,0:26:26.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.70,0:26:28.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本郡警方全然错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The county police are utterly at fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.44,0:26:29.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我关于特雷根尼斯一家的事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me what you know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.77,0:26:32.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about the fate of the Tregennis family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.61,0:26:35.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯滕代尔医生 你为什么感兴趣呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your interest, Dr. Sterndale?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.94,0:26:39.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望我这样说你能相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My claim to be taken into your confidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.28,0:26:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于我常常居于此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that during my many residences here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.18,0:26:43.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于特雷根尼斯一家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have come to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.55,0:26:45.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this family of Tregennis very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.42,0:26:48.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实上从我同是康沃尔人的母亲这边算来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed upon my Cornish mother's side{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.06,0:26:50.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是我的表亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may call them cousins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.99,0:26:52.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以他们的不幸遭遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So their strange fate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.59,0:26:55.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自然使我很震惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has naturally been a great shock to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.73,0:26:57.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道任何能够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know of anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.43,0:26:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}帮助我们调查的事情吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that could help us out in the inquiry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.20,0:27:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.40,0:27:03.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以告诉你 我得到消息的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may tell you that I had got as far as Plymouth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.64,0:27:05.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正在普利茅斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}upon my way to Africa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.07,0:27:06.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本打算前往非洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when news reached me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.80,0:27:08.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我直接回到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came straight back here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.11,0:27:10.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来看看我有什么能帮忙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to help in any way I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.75,0:27:18.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你误了船期了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you lose your boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.02,0:27:23.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会乘下一班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will take the next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.59,0:27:25.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这真是深厚的友谊啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is friendship indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.62,0:27:28.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说过了 我们是亲戚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you they were relatives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.19,0:27:30.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的行李已经上船了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did your baggage go on with boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.16,0:27:31.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.23,0:27:33.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但还有一些在旅馆里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but most of it remained in the hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.40,0:27:36.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然这个事件不会出现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well surely this event could not have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.63,0:27:38.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}普利茅斯的晨报上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}found its way into the Plymouth morning papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.77,0:27:40.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.37,0:27:41.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我接到了电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I received a telegram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.90,0:27:43.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁发的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.91,0:27:46.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真会刨根问底啊 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are very inquisitive, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.61,0:27:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.61,0:27:51.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朗德海牧师发的电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vicar, Mr. Roundhay sent it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.68,0:27:54.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫我回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}recalling me back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.55,0:27:56.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}了解了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.08,0:27:58.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以问一下你是否\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask if your suspicions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.49,0:28:02.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有特别怀疑的对向？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}point in any particular direction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.46,0:28:10.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很难回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I can hardly answer that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.36,0:28:13.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那这是在浪费我的时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'm wasting my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.55,0:28:37.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在缺少线索的情况下动脑思考\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To work the brain without sufficient material{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.62,0:28:39.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像是引擎空转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is like racing an engine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.16,0:28:43.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它自己就会分崩离析\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it cracks itself to pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.23,0:28:44.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在住处等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for me at the cottage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.06,0:28:46.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要去哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.36,0:28:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}高兴点 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheer up, Watson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.23,0:28:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海风 阳光 耐性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sea air, sunshine, patience, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.00,0:28:54.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都会真相大白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all will be revealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.81,0:29:40.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.85,0:29:42.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.32,0:29:43.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.85,0:29:46.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我们是鬼上身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, we are devil ridden, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.02,0:29:51.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这可怜的教区是鬼上身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My poor parish is devil-ridden!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.69,0:29:53.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What has happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.86,0:30:00.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约三小时前死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead about three hours I'd say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.03,0:30:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}症状与布兰达·特雷根尼斯完全相同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same symptoms exactly as Brenda Tregennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.00,0:30:05.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}四肢抽搐 手指扭曲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Limbs convulsed, fingers contorted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.50,0:30:08.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像死于突发的恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as though he died from a very paroxysm of fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.01,0:30:12.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不该发生在我的屋檐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That it should happen under my roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.51,0:30:14.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他睡过了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has his bed been slept in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.18,0:30:16.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 应该是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes, most definitely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.93,0:31:10.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁打开的窗户？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who opened this window?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.80,0:31:11.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的管家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My housekeeper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.85,0:31:14.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是今早第一个进入这个房间的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she was the first into the room this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.37,0:31:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她现在在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.18,0:31:18.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她头疼得很厉害于是卧床休息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh she's taken to her bed with a severe headache, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.51,0:31:19.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.44,0:31:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}受惊吓所致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greatly affected by the shock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.91,0:31:26.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于给您带来的不便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am most terribly sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.18,0:31:27.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我感到十分抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to inconvenience you in this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.29,0:31:30.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你们是来这里度假 但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you both came to these parts to rest but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.48,0:31:33.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想让福尔摩斯不插手是很难的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't easy with Holmes around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.25,0:31:35.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他最喜欢让自己投身于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He likes nothing better than to sink his teeth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.19,0:31:38.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into a problem of this sort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.16,0:31:39.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是两场死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But two deaths, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.29,0:31:39.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.97,0:31:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发生在两天之内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the space of two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.43,0:31:43.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the work of the devil, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.03,0:31:45.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是魔鬼作祟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}make no mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.86,0:31:48.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是相信已知和切实的东西吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your faith in the known and tangible, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.33,0:31:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朗德海先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Roundhay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.02,0:32:15.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现场没有被破坏过是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust nothing has been touched, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.89,0:32:18.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 一切完好如初\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, everything's exactly as it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.19,0:32:20.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.13,0:32:21.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要你和你的管家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll need a statement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.53,0:32:22.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做一份口供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from you and your housekeeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.03,0:32:26.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警官 我很抱歉她还病着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master, I'm afraid she's still rather ill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.37,0:32:28.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}检查下楼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check up stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.51,0:32:39.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些人是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are these gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.28,0:32:40.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 来自伦敦的夏洛克 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Mr. Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.82,0:32:43.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Doctor Watson from London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.45,0:32:49.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听过您的大名 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard of you Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.09,0:32:51.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你能将此事件的调查留给警方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd appreciate it if you would leave this inquiry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.99,0:32:53.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将不胜感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the official police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.49,0:32:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如您所愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.93,0:32:58.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是我愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.70,0:33:00.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.70,0:33:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能将警官的注意力引到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you direct the inspector's attention{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.54,0:33:05.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}楼上的窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}towards the window upstairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.44,0:33:06.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和桌子上的台灯上吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the lamp on the table?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.00,0:33:09.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这都是重要线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each is suggestive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.71,0:33:11.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有这两样 他们就差不多能得出结论了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together they are almost conclusive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.58,0:33:14.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.55,0:33:16.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下午好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.85,0:33:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.49,0:34:02.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到底在做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What on earth are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.69,0:34:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An experiment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.06,0:34:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}验证一个理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to test a theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.26,0:34:09.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是特雷根尼斯房间的台灯吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that the lamp that was in Tregennis' room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.30,0:34:11.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是也不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes and no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.77,0:34:14.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看到你买了个一模一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you bought an identical one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.94,0:34:16.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是从村子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I purchased it from{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.47,0:34:18.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一家可爱的小商铺买的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a delightful little shop in the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.50,0:34:21.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你整个下午就是去那儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where you've been all afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.97,0:34:25.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们听到的两个事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a single point of resemblance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.05,0:34:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一个共同之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the reports that we've heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.95,0:34:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关键在于第一个发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this concerns of the effect{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.65,0:34:36.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}案件的人进入房间时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the atmosphere of the room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.42,0:34:39.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所感觉到的屋内气氛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}upon those who first entered it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.12,0:34:41.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先是理查德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First Doctor Richards{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.33,0:34:43.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而后是波特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then Mrs. Porter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.56,0:34:45.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有朗德海的管家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Roundhay's housekeeper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.26,0:34:47.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今早也病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was taken ill this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.87,0:34:50.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每个案件中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In each case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.57,0:34:52.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is a combustion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.80,0:34:54.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在房内燃烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}going in the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.87,0:34:57.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第一个 是炉火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the first case, a fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.51,0:34:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二个 是灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the second, a lamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.78,0:35:01.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}炉火可能是必须的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the fire perhaps was necessary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.55,0:35:07.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但在天色大亮的时候 灯还点着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the lamp was lit when it was already broad daylight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.91,0:35:11.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将这个灯所耗的油与\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The comparison of the oil consumed in this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.09,0:35:15.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯的灯做了比较证明了这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Tregennis' lamp proves that point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.72,0:35:17.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但 为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.49,0:35:19.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某种物质燃烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something was burned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.06,0:35:22.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生成某种气体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}producing an atmosphere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.93,0:35:26.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并导致了奇特的中毒效应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and causing a strange toxic affect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.17,0:35:27.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第一个案件中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the first instance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.67,0:35:29.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在特雷根尼斯家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that of the Tregennis family, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.34,0:35:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种物质被放在炉火里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a substance was placed in the fire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.31,0:35:33.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}炉火会使烟雾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the fire would carry the fumes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.94,0:35:36.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在某种程度上扩散到烟囱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to some extent, up the chimney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.04,0:35:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有布兰达·特雷根尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only Brenda Tregennis, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.65,0:35:39.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}离炉火最近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was closest to the fire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.88,0:35:41.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.68,0:35:44.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的兄弟表现为精神错乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her brothers were exhibiting that lunacy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.32,0:35:48.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然都是毒药的初步作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is evidently the first effect of the drug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.06,0:35:51.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然另外一个案件里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other case of course{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.16,0:35:53.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是被得逞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the result was complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.19,0:35:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说是一种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's a poison, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.69,0:35:58.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}燃烧时发生作用的毒药？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which works by combustion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.73,0:36:02.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.54,0:36:04.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个明显的地方就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The obvious place to look{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.07,0:36:05.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷根尼斯房间里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was the smoke-guard of the lamp{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.84,0:36:07.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}灯的防烟罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Tregennis' room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.51,0:36:08.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那 不出所料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, sure enough, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.01,0:36:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发现了一些灰末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I perceived a number of flaky ashes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.28,0:36:14.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并在灯的边缘发现了一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and round the edges a fringe of brownish powder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.11,0:36:16.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}未烧尽的褐色粉末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which had not yet been consumed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.71,0:36:18.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我取走了一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half of it I took, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.28,0:36:21.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}留了另一半给警方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the other half I left for the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.49,0:36:24.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.39,0:36:26.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能否在我们的灯上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we can reproduce the same effects{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.26,0:36:29.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}产生同样的效果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with our own lamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.23,0:36:31.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行 福尔摩斯 这简直是疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no, Holmes, that's insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.43,0:36:33.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能强迫你留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot force you to stay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.06,0:36:38.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我要找到答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I mean to have the answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.13,0:36:41.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然我要留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I shall stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.57,0:36:44.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我了解我的华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I knew my Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.58,0:36:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把门打开好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you open the door please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.98,0:36:59.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now would you like to just sit there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.90,0:37:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.29,0:38:30.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 你必须保持清醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must stay clear Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.14,0:38:34.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则会被踩在脚下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or be trampled underfoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.25,0:38:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.28,0:38:44.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.32,0:38:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.06,0:38:50.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 能听见我说话吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.02,0:38:53.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 能听见我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For God's sake can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.66,0:38:56.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.73,0:38:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢天谢地你还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God your all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.12,0:39:00.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这真是愚蠢而危险的行径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a stupid and dangerous thing to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.40,0:39:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们可能会因此丧命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could have been killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.54,0:39:05.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个不理智的实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an unjustifiable experiment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.34,0:39:09.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即便是对自己而言 更何况是对朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even for myself, doubly so for a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.64,0:39:13.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真的非常抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But really I'm extremely sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.92,0:39:35.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有的证据都指向特雷根尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the evidence points to Tregennis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.84,0:39:37.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是第一个案件的罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being the criminal in the first tragedy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.66,0:39:39.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是第二个案件的受害者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and victim in the second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.97,0:39:40.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 如果是其他人进入房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, if anyone else would have come in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.92,0:39:43.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那家人就会从桌旁站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the family would have certainly risen from the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.58,0:39:46.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么特雷根尼斯是自杀？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then Tregennis' own death was suicide?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.15,0:39:51.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是利昂·斯滕代尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will be Doctor Leon Sterndale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.85,0:39:54.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能请他进来吗 华生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you let him in, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.13,0:40:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请进 斯滕代尔医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please come in, Doctor Sterndale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.79,0:40:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像你被料到会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems your expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.80,0:40:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一小时前收到你的便条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had your note about an hour ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.13,0:40:13.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但恕我直言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But let me state directly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.07,0:40:16.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对召唤自己的人向来粗鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't take kindly to being summoned by anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.54,0:40:20.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们还是在这儿谈一下案件情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it better to discuss the matter here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.07,0:40:21.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有被偷听的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No risk of eavesdropping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.81,0:40:22.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不明白 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fail to see, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.64,0:40:23.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你所说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what you can have to speak about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:26.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与我私人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which affects me personally{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.49,0:40:28.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}密切相关的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the most intimate fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.15,0:40:32.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫提默·特雷根尼斯的死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The killing of Mortimer Tregennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.42,0:40:38.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我长期与野人为伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have lived so long among savages{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.53,0:40:41.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不受法律约束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and beyond the law{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.33,0:40:42.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我已经习惯于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I've got into the way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.00,0:40:46.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自己就是法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of being a law unto myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.57,0:40:47.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 你最好还是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would do well, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.60,0:40:48.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to remember that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.61,0:40:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并不想加害于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for I have no desire to do you any injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.47,0:40:53.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也不想加害于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor I you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.27,0:40:55.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯滕代尔医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Sterndale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.24,0:40:57.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最好的证明就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But surely the clearest proof of it is that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.24,0:40:58.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管我知道了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knowing what I know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.54,0:40:59.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我找了您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I have sent for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.44,0:41:02.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not for the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.15,0:41:03.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你是在愚弄我 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this is a bluff upon your part, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.84,0:41:05.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你真是找错实验对象了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have chosen the wrong man for your experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.88,0:41:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不不 愚弄人的是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no the bluff is upon your side{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.45,0:41:10.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not upon mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.92,0:41:12.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我来说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I will tell you the facts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.69,0:41:15.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得出结论的事实依据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}upon which my conclusions are based.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.43,0:41:17.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你从普利茅斯回来时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of your return from Plymouth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.36,0:41:18.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把一些行李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}allowing much of your property{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.96,0:41:19.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}运到了非洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to go out to Africa, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.63,0:41:22.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这提醒了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall say nothing except that it informed me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.87,0:41:24.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是构成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was that you were one of the factors, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.80,0:41:26.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这一戏剧性事件的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which had to be taken into account{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.47,0:41:30.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}重要因素之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in reconstructing of this drama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.47,0:41:33.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}旅馆的这封电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This telegram from the hotel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.66,0:41:35.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}证实了你对我所说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}confirms what you told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.58,0:41:37.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们上次相遇的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now when we last met{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.35,0:41:39.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你问我怀疑谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you asked me whom I suspected{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.68,0:41:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我拒绝回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I refused to answer you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.68,0:41:43.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接着你就离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you departed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.15,0:41:44.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你并没有回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you didn't go home, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.92,0:41:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 斯滕代尔医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}oh no Doctor Sterndale, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.06,0:41:50.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你去了牧师的住处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you went to the vicarage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.36,0:41:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那儿等了一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you waited there for some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.63,0:41:53.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是怎么知道的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.06,0:41:56.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我跟踪了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I followed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.73,0:41:58.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我谁也没看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.26,0:42:00.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我跟踪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is what you may expect to see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.40,0:42:02.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自然不愿被你看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I follow you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.40,0:42:04.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你彻夜未眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You spent a restless night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.61,0:42:09.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}制定了一个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made certain plans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.41,0:42:10.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备第二天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then in the early hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.01,0:42:15.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}清晨执行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you proceeded to put them into action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.11,0:42:18.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你回到牧师的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You returned to the vicarage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.45,0:42:21.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在悬崖小路上拾了几颗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Collected some distinctive red gravel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.15,0:42:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特别的红色石子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the cliff path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.83,0:42:32.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天已大亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The house by now was daylight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.80,0:42:36.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但屋里还没有动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the inhabitants were not stirring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.60,0:42:38.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你朝特雷根尼斯的窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You threw some of the red gravel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.90,0:42:41.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}扔了几颗红色石子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}up at the window of Tregennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.41,0:42:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯滕代尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sterndale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.82,0:43:03.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须马上跟你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must speak with you urgently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.66,0:43:05.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This hour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.36,0:43:06.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}门锁着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doors are locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.64,0:43:07.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}管家拿着钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The housekeeper has the keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.93,0:43:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这事至关重大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is of the utmost importance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.34,0:43:23.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你从开着的窗子进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You entered through the sitting window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.28,0:43:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们进行了很短的会谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had an interview, a short one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.31,0:43:31.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在屋子里来回踱步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you walked up and down the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.05,0:43:34.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对你的到来害怕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He withdrew as you had come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.62,0:43:38.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你当时穿着和现在脚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wearing the same pair of studied walking shoes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.72,0:43:42.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一样的步行鞋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which at the present moment are upon your feet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.63,0:43:47.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而莫提默·特雷根尼斯死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Mortimer Tregennis was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.24,0:43:57.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你送给布兰达·特雷根尼斯的戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ring you gave Brenda Tregennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.61,0:44:00.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.78,0:44:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.12,0:44:10.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰达·特雷根尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brenda Tregennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.43,0:44:25.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多年来我深爱着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For years I loved her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.63,0:44:30.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她也深爱着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For years she loved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.11,0:44:34.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是人们所惊奇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is the secret of the Cornish seclusion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.88,0:44:39.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我隐居在康沃尔的秘密所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which people so marveled at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.71,0:44:41.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样我才能接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It brought me close to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.38,0:44:43.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个世界上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the one person on this earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.89,0:44:47.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最心爱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who was dear to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.63,0:44:50.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能娶她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't marry her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.66,0:44:54.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管妻子离开我多年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for I had a wife who left me for whom, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.12,0:44:57.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但因为英格兰可悲的法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the deplorable laws of England, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.26,0:45:00.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能离婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could not divorce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.80,0:45:03.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多年来布兰达一直等待着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For years Brenda waited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.00,0:45:08.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多年来我一直等待着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For years I waited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.44,0:45:14.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而这竟是我们等来的结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is what we waited for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.18,0:45:21.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朗德海知道这秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roundhay knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.35,0:45:22.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们信任他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was in our confidence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.57,0:45:25.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此他拍电报到普利茅斯告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hence his telegram to me at Plymouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.39,0:45:30.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我得知心上人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was my baggage or Africa to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.03,0:45:32.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遭此不幸时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I learned that such a fate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.86,0:45:36.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}行李和非洲对我又算得了什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had befallen my darling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.70,0:45:39.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就是这么得知我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you have the missing clue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.37,0:45:41.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不为人知的秘密吧 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to my actions, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.75,0:45:55.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand that you sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.88,0:45:58.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是位医生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are a doctor of medicine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.02,0:46:03.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你听过"Radix pedis diaboli"这种制剂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever heard of "Radix pedis diaboli"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.33,0:46:06.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}魔鬼脚跟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Devils foot root.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.53,0:46:09.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 从未听过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No I can't say that I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.20,0:46:11.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不能怪你的专业知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well there's no reflection upon your professional knowledge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.73,0:46:15.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信 除了放在布达某实验室的一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for I believe that, save for one sample in a laboratory at Buda, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.48,0:46:18.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欧洲再没有其他样本了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is no other specimen in Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.31,0:46:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这被西非某些地区的医师用作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is used as an ordeal poison by the medicine men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.97,0:46:26.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}刑讯的毒药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in certain districts of West Africa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.11,0:46:30.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并被严加保管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it is kept as a secret by them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.99,0:46:35.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已经知道很多事了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already know so much, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.62,0:46:39.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但还是让我把全部事实告诉你为好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is clearly to my interest that you should know all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.93,0:46:43.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经解释过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have already explained{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.46,0:46:47.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和特雷根尼斯家族的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the relationship in which I stood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.03,0:46:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们家曾因财产而发生过争吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the Tregennis family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.64,0:46:51.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此与莫提默疏远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There had been quarrel about money, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.74,0:46:55.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个阴险狡诈的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which estranged this man Mortimer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.27,0:46:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但因为布兰达的缘故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a sly, subtle, scheming man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.28,0:46:59.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对她的哥哥很友善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but for Brenda's sake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.68,0:47:01.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几周前的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was friendly with her brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.71,0:47:03.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他来到我的住处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then one day a few weeks ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.85,0:47:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给他展示了一些非洲珍奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he came to my cottage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.85,0:47:09.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I showed him some of my African curiosities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.79,0:47:13.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还给他展示了"魔鬼之足"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Among other things, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.36,0:47:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是毒药？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I exhibited the Devil's foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.19,0:47:16.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poison you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.96,0:47:19.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没试过不会相信的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fascinating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.36,0:47:21.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点点就能够致命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't think so if you were to try it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.63,0:47:23.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这种粉末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The smallest amount could be fatal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.43,0:47:26.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在燃烧时会即刻反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this powder form{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.70,0:47:28.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}刺激大脑中枢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it reacts instantaneously when burned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.40,0:47:31.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}控制恐惧情感的区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It stimulates those brain centers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.47,0:47:34.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非疯即死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which control the emotion of fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.61,0:47:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些不幸的本地人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madness or death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.95,0:47:38.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若是遭受部落医师的折磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the fate of the unfortunate native{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.05,0:47:41.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是这样的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who is subjected to the ordeal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.38,0:47:43.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会被发现吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the priest of his tribe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.95,0:47:47.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欧洲科学是不能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can it be detected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.66,0:47:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几天后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not by European science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.16,0:47:51.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的住处有人闯空门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few days later{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.33,0:47:53.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但貌似什么都没拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my cottage was broken into{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.96,0:47:55.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有留意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but since nothing seemed to have been taken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.86,0:47:57.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到郎德海先生的电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave the matter no heed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.73,0:47:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到达普利茅斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until Mr. Roundhay's telegram{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.70,0:48:03.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫提默这个恶棍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}arrived at Plymouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.30,0:48:04.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以为我得知消息的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This villain, Mortimer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.84,0:48:06.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经在海上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had thought that I would be at sea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.64,0:48:10.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并一去非洲很多年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before news reached me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.54,0:48:13.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我当然立刻回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that I should be lost for years in Africa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.61,0:48:16.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一听到详细情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But of course I returned immediately{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.25,0:48:18.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就能断定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I could not hear the details{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.55,0:48:21.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他用的正是我的毒药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without being assured that it was my poison, which had been used, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.18,0:48:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而莫提默·特雷根尼斯本人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that Mortimer Tregennis himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.29,0:48:28.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was the murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.89,0:48:33.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一心要报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sole cried out for revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.26,0:48:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You murdered her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.87,0:48:39.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了钱你杀了自己的亲妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For money you murdered your own sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.47,0:48:41.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没有证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't prove that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.51,0:48:43.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当地陪审团不会相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No jury in the land will believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.04,0:48:46.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就是陪审团 特雷根尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm my own jury, Mr. Tregennis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.91,0:48:52.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法官 陪审团和刽子手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judge, jury and executioner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.54,0:49:19.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我点燃了台灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lit the lamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.34,0:49:21.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把粉末放到上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put the powder above it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.41,0:49:43.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}五分钟后他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In five minutes he died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.63,0:49:44.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.59,0:49:46.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死状其惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How he died!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.47,0:49:53.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我不为所动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my heart was flint, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.20,0:49:54.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他仅仅是经历了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for he endured nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.94,0:49:56.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无辜的心上人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which my innocent darling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.68,0:49:59.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之前所经历的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had not suffered before him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.82,0:50:10.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以采取任何行动 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can take what steps you like, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.52,0:50:13.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但没有什么谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there can be no man living{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.36,0:50:17.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会比我现在更无惧死亡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who fears death less than I do now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.46,0:50:29.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你原本是怎么计划的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What where your plans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.27,0:50:34.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我打算把自己葬在中非\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was intending to bury myself in Central Africa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.34,0:50:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那儿的工作只进行了一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My work there is but half done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.65,0:50:47.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就去完成另外一半吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go and do the other half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.69,0:50:54.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我个人不打算阻止你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, for one, am not prepared to stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.04,0:51:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God bless you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.61,0:51:07.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们两位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.21,0:51:21.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经不是第一次了 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for the first time, Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.09,0:51:24.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把法律玩弄于股掌之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you presume to take the law into your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.09,0:51:31.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未爱过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have never loved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.36,0:51:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但如果有过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if I did{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.87,0:51:35.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果这个我爱的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if the woman I had loved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.67,0:51:37.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遭此不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had met with such an end{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.67,0:51:40.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可能也会跟我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might act even as our{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.10,0:51:44.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无视法律的猎狮者有相同的举动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lawless lion-hunter has done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.41,0:51:47.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不会吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.21,0:51:50.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 可能吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I suppose so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.31,0:51:51.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这不是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that's not the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.05,0:51:55.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关键是我为什么要做警方的工作呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The point is why should I do the work of the official police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.39,0:51:59.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且正如你所言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as your very fond of telling me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.12,0:52:01.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在休假中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on holiday!{\r}
